361, "date": 1765497600, "platform": 167, "y": 2025, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1822262, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322e.jpg"}, {"id": 1822264, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322g.jpg"}, {"id": 1822268, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322k.jpg"}, {"id": 1822270, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322m.jpg"}, {"id": 1822275, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322r.jpg"}, {"id": 1822261, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322d.jpg"}, {"id": 1822263, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322f.jpg"}, {"id": 1822265, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322h.jpg"}, {"id": 1822267, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322j.jpg"}, {"id": 1822269, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322l.jpg"}, {"id": 1822272, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322o.jpg"}, {"id": 1822273, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322p.jpg"}, {"id": 1822274, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322q.jpg"}, {"id": 1822266, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322i.jpg"}, {"id": 1822271, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1322n.jpg"}], "slug": "arknights-endfield", "storyline": "Welcome to Talos-II, a world of breathtaking beauty and constant danger. The earliest settlers braved wars and disasters, and through more than 150 years of relentless effort, they carved out a foothold and laid out a new foundation for humanity \u2014 the Civilization Band. Yet most of this world remains untamed. Vast wildlands and uninhabited territories stretching toward the horizon still await exploration. Every step forward is shadowed by threats \u2014 whether remnants of the past or dangers never before seen.\n\nExpansion and exploration, as well as continuity and progression, are the eternal themes throughout the evolution of civilization, and the ultimate pursuit of every life that constitutes it.\n\nAs the Endministrator of Endfield Industries, you will lead your operators to defend and expand the frontiers of humanity. Your Originium engines rumble in the wildlands while production machinery works around the clock to deploy new AIC Factory production lines. Explore the world of Talos-II and gather various resources. Use the AIC Factory to overcome dangers and work with the operators to build a better homeland for humanity.\n\nA new era of change has dawned upon this ancient world. Time to make your choice, Endministrator.", "summary": "Arknights: Endfield is a 3D real-time strategy RPG developed by HYPERGRYPH. You will take on the role of the Endministrator of Endfield Industries, set out across Talos-II to uncover its secrets, and defend and expand the frontiers of human civilization.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/arknights-endfield", "videos": [{"id": 190298, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "xxURfVAVSfE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xxURfVAVSfE", "title": "Arknights: Endfield Companionship Celebration & Core Chapter [Homecoming] Version Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xxURfVAVSfE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 65563, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "oo0deb64GNw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oo0deb64GNw", "title": "Arknights: Endfield CG Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oo0deb64GNw/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 65565, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "So84QFZWYOQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=So84QFZWYOQ", "title": "Arknights: Endfield Premiere Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/So84QFZWYOQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 103062, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Yt7eUS1X0Ec", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yt7eUS1X0Ec", "title": "Arknights: Endfiel